    "title": "What stores are open on Easter Sunday? Are Target, Walmart and Kroger closed for Easter shopping?",
    "text": "March 30, 2026Updated March 31, 2026, 10:16 a.m. ETEaster 2026 will be celebrated on Sunday, April 5, for most Western Christians.Many major retailers, including Target, Costco, and Macy's, are expected to be closed on Easter Sunday.Several stores like Walmart, Kroger, and Home Depot are anticipated to remain open for the holiday.Shoppers are advised to call their local stores to confirm holiday hours as exceptions may apply.Easter is almost here, and you may have last-minute shopping needs. What stores will be closed, and which stores will be open, if you need to pick something up?Here's what we know about which Easter stores are closed and open:When is Easter 2026? What date is Easter Sunday this year?Easter 2026 will be celebrated on Sunday, April 5, for most Christians, predominantly Catholics and Protestants. Orthodox Christians will celebrate on Sunday, April 12.Save on Easter supplies with Amazon Prime2026 Easter store closings: What stores are closed on Easter Sunday?Here's a list of stores expected to be closed on Easter Sunday. Each of these stores will have some location closures for Easter, or are expected to be closed based on recent holiday closures. Please call ahead to your local, as there are always exceptions:AldiAppleBanana RepublicBath and Body WorksBest BuyBloomingdale'sBob's Discount FurnitureBurlingtonThe Container StoreCostcoCrate + BarrelDick's Sporting GoodFive BelowGapGoodwillH-E-B GroceryThe Honey Baked Ham CompanyHobby LobbyJCPenneyKohl'sHomeGoodsLowe'sMacy'sMarshallsMichael'sNordstromNordstrom RackOffice DepotPublixSam's ClubStaplesSuperCutsTargetT.J. Maxx2026 Easter stores open: What stores are open on Easter Sunday?Here's a list of stores expected to be open on Easter Sunday. Each of these stores will be open at most locations on Easter, or are expected to be open based on recent holiday participation. Please call ahead to your local store, as there are always exceptions:Ace HardwareAlbertson'sBarnes & NobleBass Pro ShopsBig LotsBJs Wholesale ClubCabela'sCVSDollar GeneralFresh MarketOrder groceries with InstacartHome DepotIKEAKrogerOld NavyPetcoPetSmartRite AidSafewayStarbucksTrader Joe'sWalmartWalgreensWhole FoodsChris Sims is a trending reporter at Midwest Connect Gannett. Follow him on Twitter: @ChrisFSims.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
